eedback, it is indeed a problem. I will immediately add the form reset logic to the `onCancel` and `afterClose` events of the pop-up window. I'll submit the code later, please help me check it again."}, {"source_id": 5, "record_author": "Zixuan Qin", "recorded_at": "2025-11-25 16:10:00", "text": ""Custom Report Generation" is a bit complicated to operate. I've drawn a flowchart and put it in the draft. Manager Yu Su, Jingwei Sun, please help me check if this diagram is clear and easy to understand, and if it will cause any trouble for users?"}, {"source_id": 6, "record_author": "Li Xiao", "recorded_at": "2025-03-12 09:45:10", "text": "@Jianguo Huang @Mingzhi Li Hello Bosses, I'm starting to create the project budget tracking sheet today. Could you give me a rough estimate for some of the cost estimations mentioned yesterday, especially for software procurement, cloud resources, and hardware expenses? This would help me set up the initial budget framework."}, {"source_id": 7, "record_author": "Lizhen Zhou", "recorded_at": "2025-02-11 10:45:30", "text": "@Hong Gong I see you're discussing ERP interfaces. If there are any obstacles in communicating with IT this afternoon, or if the business department needs clarification on data caliber, you can always pull me or @Bo Chen from our team in. Ensuring accurate financial and procurement data is crucial for the accuracy of our subsequent carbon asset accounting."}, {"source_id": 8, "record_author": "Xuexin Yin", "recorded_at": "2025-06-18 10:05:50", "text": "@Qing Wei I'm currently writing tests for the invitation API. Once that's done, I'll immediately add the roles field to the `/me` interface. It should be quick, I'll definitely get it to you this afternoon. You can continue using mock data on your end for now, a format like `[ 'admin', 'user' ]` will work."}]}

