revealed an issue: under high concurrency, there's an extremely low probability of message order disruption. My preliminary judgment is that it's a configuration problem with a certain message processing thread pool, and I'm currently investigating."}, {"source_id": 12, "record_author": "Li Jin", "recorded_at": "2025-07-15 09:22:40", "text": "My WebSocket service is progressing smoothly. I'm currently refining the message body (payload) design based on Huilan Chen's previous suggestions to ensure good scalability. Currently, I've divided messages into three types: 'user private chat', 'system notification', and 'heartbeat detection', and defined different topics and data structures for each type. The first draft of the design document has been uploaded to Confluence."}, {"source_id": 13, "record_author": "Huilan Chen", "recorded_at": "2025-10-17 09:25:00", "text": "@Peng Sun, thanks for your hard work. Browser compatibility testing must be closed today, especially the Safari issue. It directly affects the experience of a large group of users, so we can't take it lightly. @Xiaofang Tang, the stress test is progressing well. Please proceed as planned and expose potential performance bottlenecks in advance."}, {"source_id": 14, "record_author": "Si Jia", "recorded_at": "2025-03-26 14:30:00", "text": "I am currently writing the self-developed section of the IM solution. If we were to develop it from scratch based on WebSocket, although it offers the highest flexibility, the workload would be enormous to implement features such as reliable message delivery (ACK mechanism, retransmission strategy), offline messages, multi-device synchronization, and historical message roaming. Moreover, it would be very prone to bugs. I will highlight the risks and human resource investment in this area in the report."}, {"source_id": 15, "record_author": "Yunqi Qian", "recorded_at": "2025-08-27 09:15:20", "text": "Good morning. Yesterday, I handled the empty state UI for the chronic disease program details page. Today, I'm mainly addressing style compatibility issues across different screen sizes to ensure the display on both phones and iPads matches the design mockups."}]}

